      "content": "exactly. it's like i'm just playing a game where the rules don't matter and the score doesn't count. everything feels so hollow. sometimes i wonder if the only way to actually stop feeling this weight is to just... stop fighting it. like, if there's no point, why keep struggling against the ocean?",
